{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surgery was a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain remains your own. But the body does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future city designed for efficiency, free autonomous vehicles move through the streets, while at its center rises a vast tower where work and leisure converge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you return to daily life, your own scent begins to feel subtly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you follow that unease to its source, the boundary between self and body slowly begins to blur.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through smell \u2014 a sense that reaches directly into the deeper parts of the brain \u2014 a hidden system within the body quietly reveals itself.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204100?t=1773368614","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3204100?t=1773368614","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/2a4b48641ab8942bad86bde7c96f6279b295b8e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773368614","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3204100/2a4b48641ab8942bad86bde7c96f6279b295b8e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773368614","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The surgery was a success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your brain remains your own. But the body does not.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a near-future city designed for efficiency, free autonomous vehicles move through the streets, while at its center rises a vast tower where work and leisure converge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you return to daily life, your own scent begins to feel subtly wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you follow that unease to its source, the boun